*dc transient (capacitive n inductive)
*V1 1 0 5
*R1 1 2 1k
*C1 2 0 1u

*dc sweep (for some reason it shows v1 node plot only)
*V1 1 0 12.0
*I1 0 2 2m
*R1 1 2 4k
*R2 2 3 1k
*D1 3 0

*half wave rectifier (ac transient)
*V1 1 0 SINE 10.0 60
*D1 1 2
*R1 2 0 1k


*high pass filter (ac sweep)
*V1 1 0 AC 5.0 0
*C1 1 2 1u
*R1 2 0 1k

* BSIM4.8.3 CMOS Inverter Voltage Transfer Curve (VTC)
VIN 2 0 1.8
VDD 1 0 1.8
R_LOAD 3 0 100meg
M_N 3 2 0 0 NMOD W=1.2u L=1u MULT_I=1
M_P 3 2 1 1 PMOD W=2.4u L=1u MULT_I=1
.MODEL NMOD NMOS VERSION=4.83 VTH0=0.42 U0=450 TOXE=3.0n
.MODEL PMOD PMOS VERSION=4.83 VTH0=-0.42 U0=200 TOXE=3.0n